       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ADD-SUBTRACT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 FIRST-NUMBER PIC 999 VALUE 150.
       01 SECOND-NUMBER PIC 999 VALUE 75.
       01 TOTAL PIC 9999 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           ADD FIRST-NUMBER TO SECOND-NUMBER.
           DISPLAY "AFTER ADDITION: " SECOND-NUMBER.
           ADD FIRST-NUMBER SECOND-NUMBER GIVING TOTAL.
           DISPLAY "SUM: " TOTAL.
           SUBTRACT 25 FROM TOTAL.
           DISPLAY "AFTER SUBTRACTION: " TOTAL.
           STOP RUN.
